text.section:
Unless otherwise part of the public record, the Office shall not release any of the following confidential information to the general public:

Records relating to a mental health evaluation or treatment of a parent or child;


Records relating to the evaluation or treatment of a substance abuse-related disorder of a parent or child;


Records relating to a medical diagnosis or treatment of a parent or child;


Records relating to domestic violence-related services and sexual assault services provided to a parent or child; or


Records relating to educational services provided to a parent or child.
